alse,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?u=f0c85fe8c24debe91dc14d7efa97b51a19250b47&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","login":"kitbdev","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev"},"body":"Categories look good to me, the organization is helpful.\r\n\r\nUnlike previous setting changes, these ones are a lot more common, especially settings like `interface/editor/editor_language` or `interface/editor/main_font_size` (https://github.com/search?q=%22interface%2Feditor%22+lang%3AGDScript+&type=code). So I think we should have compatibility for it.\r\n`_rename_setting` could add to a compatibility-only hashmap and then it can be checked in `get` / `set` / `has_setting`.\r\n\r\nI found some new setting uses that will need to be changed (needs rebase):\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/a3e84cc2af14aa4cffbefd8e13492e59567a64e3/editor/gui/code_editor.cpp#L1637\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/a3e84cc2af14aa4cffbefd8e13492e59567a64e3/editor/themes/editor_fonts.cpp#L434\r\n","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114971#pullrequestreview-3838879641","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114971","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-02-23T02:54:40Z"},{"id":3855706795,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7l0Wqr","state":"APPROVED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?u=f0c85fe8c24debe91dc14d7efa97b51a19250b47&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","login":"kitbdev","type":"User","owned_private_repos